      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Are you coming to the meeting?">
        <p class="quiz-question">2. Which question is correct?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Are you coming to the meeting?">Are you coming to the meeting?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Do you coming to the meeting?">Do you coming to the meeting?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="You are coming to the meeting?">You are coming to the meeting?</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="aren’t">
        <p class="quiz-question">3. We ___ watching the game. We’re still at work.</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="aren’t">aren’t</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="don’t">don’t</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="isn’t">isn’t</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="isn’t">
        <p class="quiz-question">4. Is Marta working today? No, she ___.</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="isn’t">isn’t</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="isn’t working">isn’t working</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="doesn’t">doesn’t</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="She’s taking the bus.">
